{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>And the cities of the Levites.</b> Forty-eight cities that were given to them." "<b>Everlasting redemption.</b> He redeems from the hand — even before two years. If they sold a field from the fields given to them within two thousand cubits around the cities, or if they sold a house in a walled city, they redeem forever, and it is not forfeited at the end of the year (ibid.)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:22.866783833Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}